### Create Jane Doe
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
    "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### Create John Doe
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "password": "JohnPass123!"
}

### Bulk create multiple users in a single atomic transaction
### All users are created together, or all are rolled back on any error
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/users/create-many
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN>
{
    "users": [
        {
            "firstName": "Emma",
            "lastName": "Stone",
            "email": "emma.stone@example.com",
            "password": "EmmaPass123!"
        },
        {
            "firstName": "Liam",
            "lastName": "Turner",
            "email": "liam.turner@example.com",
            "password": "LiamPass123!"
        },
        {
            "firstName": "Olivia",
            "lastName": "Bennett",
            "email": "olivia.bennett@example.com",
            "password": "OliviaPass123!"
        },
        {
            "firstName": "Noah",
            "lastName": "Walker",
            "email": "noah.walker@example.com",
            "password": "NoahPass123!"
        }
    ]
}